{"4349540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pillars of Pantheon", "steam_appid": 4349540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/0061095c834af892ffb18eb574718751.avif?t=1788204485\" width=740 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.poster.avif?t=1788204485\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.webm?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.mp4?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/05fa76975c37a59ddd60348dfc13d991.webp?t=1788204485\" width=643 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pillars of Pantheon is a bullet-heaven “tower offense” roguelite. Build and customize the ultimate Roman siege tower by stacking marble blocks, ballistae, spears, shields, and mythical artifacts. Charge straight into overwhelming enemy hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/3b000b2abdce2e2ce7769edfa4a389a3.poster.avif?t=1788204485\" width=584 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/3b000b2abdce2e2ce7769edfa4a389a3.webm?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/3b000b2abdce2e2ce7769edfa4a389a3.mp4?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/eb381e0479eca699bcb9498695e48b50.webp?t=1788204485\" width=643 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the favor of the Roman gods to unlock devastating abilities, summon allied minions, and reshape your siege tower into a moving engine of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/5c32aaf04e8222234589cea5f54c5c9c.poster.avif?t=1788204485\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/5c32aaf04e8222234589cea5f54c5c9c.webm?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/5c32aaf04e8222234589cea5f54c5c9c.mp4?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maps inspired by real Mediterranean locations, defeat iconic bosses, and face unforgiving challenges. Experiment with synergies, divine powers, and architectural creativity to survive the horrors of the underworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/f5a97405fb17802b4544990b6ed7ded9.webp?t=1788204485\" width=643 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pillar to your heart’s desire. Gain Venus’ favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/ed3202a055949445617c78c3f28925d0.poster.avif?t=1788204485\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/ed3202a055949445617c78c3f28925d0.webm?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/ed3202a055949445617c78c3f28925d0.mp4?t=1788204485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/d383eaa1f605779d988303bc8d89c3fb.webp?t=1788204485\" width=650 height=38 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable building system featuring many unique blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman mythology-inspired environments and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God-powered abilities that reshape combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression with high replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand tall. Build with style. Or be reduced to rubble.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349540/extras/0061095c834af892ffb18eb574718751.avif?t=1788204485\" w